  </div>
</div>
      
      <div data-item-count="4" data-field-entity-type="node" data-field-entity-bundle="update" data-field-entity-view-mode="full" data-field-name="field_content" data-field-type="entity_reference_revisions" class="field field--name--field_content field--type--entity_reference_revisions field--label--hidden node--update--full--field-content node--full--field-content field--name-field-content field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field--items">
              <div class="field--item node--update--full--item node--full--item" data-item-delta="0">  <div class="paragraph paragraph-section paragraph--default paragraph-section-default paragraph-background-1 section-background-white paragraph-hide-on-screen--xs--visible paragraph-hide-on-screen--sm--visible paragraph-hide-on-screen--md--visible spacing-section-vertical-default-top spacing-section-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--section paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="section" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="12031" data-paragraph-type="section" data-paragraph-id="12031" data-fullwidth-paragraph>
            <div class="layout layout--one-0-4-0-col">

    <div class="section-content-container">
      <div class="row">
                  <div  class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-10 offset-lg-1 layout__region layout__region--first">
              <div class="paragraph paragraph-text paragraph--default paragraph-text-default spacing-paragraph-right-no spacing-paragraph-left-no spacing-paragraph-vertical-default-bottom paragraph--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default" data-entity-type="paragraph" data-bundle="text" data-view-mode="default" data-entity-id="12032" data-paragraph-type="text" data-paragraph-id="12032">
          
            <div data-item-count="1" data-field-entity-type="paragraph" data-field-entity-bundle="text" data-field-entity-view-mode="default" data-field-name="field_text" data-field-type="text_long" class="field field--name--field_text field--type--text_long field--label--hidden paragraph--text--default--field-text paragraph--default--field-text field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden paragraph--text--default--item paragraph--default--item field--item"><p>As part of the preparations for the transition to the common <span>ADEX Intraday Continuous Market</span>, the first ADEX IDCM Members Workshop was held on <span>8 September 2026</span>.</p><p>The session focused on Member testing, connectivity and access preparation ahead of the planned go-live. The presentation from the workshop is available:</p></div>
      
      </div>
